{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "eda2832f262346bdea348f9995493c05749125432ac22f089bf8b8145fd81215", "ja": "強襲", "zh": "突袭", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e8ad5135b360f3d20ab25abbc0e88abc50e645789dd174757bb21bbc09fb6d08", "ja": "マイティセーラー百合子と海美の力で、\r\n『デストルジャベリン』は打ち返される。\r\nしかしネメシス総帥カオリの真の狙いは、\r\nザ・ファーストとザ・セカンドの命だった。\r\n『黒髪』マコトが、2人を急襲する。", "zh": "『Mighty Sailor』的百合子与海美\n合力将『死欲标枪』打了回去。\n但Nemesis总帅歌织的真正目的，\n是取The First以及The Next的命。\n『黑发』真锁定两人，发动了突袭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "23bfbec54e9915f6b39c465a6554a717cc482a6d0693c5466cb7932dcf0dbfc3", "ja": "あっ、見えてきた！\nあれが、『デストルジャベリン』……！？", "zh": "啊，看到了！\n那个就是『死欲标枪』……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1000_se", "source_sha256": "97e3801cfb44c4335ade7d0b4cd6db55f070398af698825334e0fda44cc39aca", "ja": "ゴゴゴゴゴ……", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "fff839a9d68b92764311aee1680903c18655f639640b7147caf7c55d74299fb2", "ja": "ウソ！？　あんなのが落ちてきたら、\n都市どころか日本が壊滅しちゃいそう！？", "zh": "不会吧！？那种东西要是掉下来，\n别说这个都市了，连整个日本都会毁灭吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "50052f62d1218a0dbf3eae4074e126fd06042af718c01a3e4ed3f87cf0c92f34", "ja": "それでも、二人で止めるしかない……行こう、海美！\n拘束解除！　……キネティックパワー、解放！", "zh": "就算这样，也只能靠我们两个挡下它了……上吧，海美！\n解除拘束！动能威力，解放！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "0040effbe7d722e35fe5bf126a005817b11dab9324b3a56f13af3c57842bb4a1", "ja": "うん！　私と百合子のキネティックパワーを\n合わせて！　間に合えーっ！", "zh": "嗯！融合我和百合子的动能威力！\n千万要赶上啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "3e428fe29d1939f912702b635ceacd81c2ac565debe68f82be309a1eef7080ba", "ja": "はああああぁーっ！！", "zh": "喝啊啊啊啊啊──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "09a6841c4ecaecdc2e62a8c9cafccefbc09a31c20716f82b96f0099cb75ef5f8", "ja": "どりゃああぁーっ！！", "zh": "上呀啊啊啊啊──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1007_nemsisusenntouin", "source_sha256": "c4a3a1bf19a569c327612d01dd9c4ad84ecea2dd2a1f046a1624f409aee65081", "ja": "だ、ダークセーラー様！\nデストルジャベリンが打ち返されました！", "zh": "Da、Dark Sailor大人！\n死欲标枪被打回来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "c5947ad86a324bb4cc98d7216598154885cdc5643252e7de972f659f20f7ea43", "ja": "なんだと！？　いつの間にこちらの計画が……\nおのれ、マイティセーラーズ！", "zh": "什么！？计划是何时曝光的……\n可恶的『Mighty Sailors』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "e0169e73b8c52fa1cacbf94a82d26492a58bc489ca5d3c1b33c65040041280e8", "ja": "今回の作戦は失敗のようね……。まあいいわ。\n撤退する。これ以上の戦いは、時間のムダよ。", "zh": "看来这次的作战是失败了……也罢，撤退吧。\n继续战斗也只是浪费时间而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "f680a94331988b2e929d2a6947ac66b60cec5351fed965199c7c5db98a09ec5f", "ja": "久しぶりね、歌織。こんな形で再会する事に\nなるなんて、思ってもみなかったけど……。", "zh": "好久不见了，歌织。\n真没想到会以这种形式与你重逢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "ba146a4767de8a67ab8254217b55052397b71a448ae18d2e8a474c1a745f000c", "ja": "特務機関ネメシス。デストルジャベリンは、\nマイティセーラーズが止めた。計画は潰えたわ。", "zh": "特务机构Nemesis，死欲标枪已经被\n『Mighty Sailors』挡下，你们的计划失败了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "9777ed7939c7932274cac8778a033fd779f2b3d44a83e63901489912b8b41487", "ja": "我々の計画なら、予定通り進行中だ。\n寸分の狂いもなく。", "zh": "我们的计划正按照预定顺利进行，\n半点差池都没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "8f08397b4e17f0167b45e9dc039f318bb455f41dd466ef7c987803a5a7fd47f3", "ja": "なんですって？\n歌織……それはどういう意味なの！", "zh": "你说什么？\n歌织……这话是什么意思！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "9fe712fc02d69184377de93098290c05e6888694b01e363faab1e0497ee06a6a", "ja": "デストルジャベリン計画は、参謀本部のシホが\n持ち込んだもの。我々は協力したに過ぎない。", "zh": "死欲标枪计划是参谋总部的志保提的，\n我们不过是出点力罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "e38f64a5c51fa9a6388056ca9a74a781cde6bce0ba4311babe1b229c470f7068", "ja": "我々ネメシスの狙いは、始めからただひとつ。\nザ・ファースト、ザ・ネクスト。貴様らの命だけだ。", "zh": "我们Nemesis的目标，打从一开始就只有一个。\nThe First、The Next……就是你们两个的命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "8883f2d92266205b60f8a47782eca95e8117bb9478faf9f64218c88d469125c9", "ja": "まさか……大規模な襲撃も、デストルジャベリンも、\nこちらの戦力を分散させるために！？", "zh": "难道说……大规模袭击和死欲标枪，\n都是为了分散我们的战力！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "fb57ad3ce640afdab80d8cad8d592d623e721fa52ada23410add88bea54187d6", "ja": "その価値は、十分にあったと思うがな？\n全ては、この一瞬のため……。", "zh": "我是觉得很划算喔，\n一切都是为了成就此时此刻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "80524b2a2bfa6a5a3a15d01ceefe5aa186a934e7729f90bf707b9aa85cb04a4a", "ja": "正義などという欺瞞をいくら盾にしたところで、\n貴様らが使う力もまた、所詮暴力にすぎない。", "zh": "就算拿正义这种的伪善口号当挡箭牌，\n你们所使用的力量，终究也跟暴力没两样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "41fc022492598dcafa9dbceca9125d3da4b5f3a33abd2d121ee398c20af65e6d", "ja": "さあ、英雄達よ！　今こそ楽しもうではないか。\n我々の、我々だけが持つ、純粋なまでの暴力を！", "zh": "来吧，英雄们！现在就是享乐的时刻！\n享受我们的、我们与生独具的纯粹暴力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "797b150c06101ad2d7f033589f6f72d78ce569f4644cc57879c1aeda10434627", "ja": "……完全に、闇に飲み込まれてしまったのね。\nいいわ、歌織。貴女が還らないというのなら……。", "zh": "……看来你已经彻底堕入黑暗了。\n好吧，歌织，既然你如此执迷不悟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "089c4941a9f76c02ad85476cdc5304bc8c31db72213d11e589b719bc6985a364", "ja": "私達の手で、終わらせてあげる。", "zh": "我们就亲手了断你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1023_006mak", "source_sha256": "4fbbef0e19062ec62080365ea0d902774ad5986c07750cfab8255f93dcc79017", "ja": "へえ……冷たいんだね。", "zh": "哦……这么无情呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1025_se", "source_sha256": "be80f7e52bb20fd71d42926c61eb00bacba53c4dcf480f1c5bbdd446355fcbd2", "ja": "ヴンッ！", "zh": "轰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "60de247e84b3dfbef446f4294bf9b746f4c9fb425696439eec89249ac801bfdb", "ja": "っ！？　な、何……！\nこの凄まじいまでのプレッシャーは！！", "zh": "唔！？怎、怎么了……！\n这股惊人的压迫感是！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "4a79e87e5b39a6f160b29e91d59ea983dd2e32f50e3912039b7031352c3a9b0a", "ja": "初めまして、ザ・ファースト、ザ・ネクスト。\nそして……永遠に、さようなら。", "zh": "The First、The Next，两位好。\n然后……永别了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_06_1027_se", "source_sha256": "55802282d7ca59cf9be989500ab8ae45d3318af12f07fdd365d5eb0e9b7b0b19", "ja": "ズドンッ！", "zh": "轰隆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
